  "body": "In https://github.com/protocol-registries/http-fields/issues/17#issuecomment-964002361 (and related issues), @mnot noted that HTML's IANA considerations don't match the current registration template.\r\n\r\nhttps://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/iana.html#cross-origin-opener-policy-report-only, for example, has fields that the registration request templat doesn't: https://github.com/protocol-registries/http-fields/issues/new?assignees=&labels=new+registration&template=registration-request.md&title=",
